{"text": "# New hire IT setup — Thandiwe Mokoena-Hart (Claims Analyst)\n\n**Start date:** 2026-05-18 · **Manager:** Leilani Kahananui · **Employee ID:** BBG-00618\n**Ticket:** NL-48213 · **Tech:** Gus Papadakis (Northloop Managed IT, 612-555-0177)\n\n> Internal use only. Do not paste this page into chat tools. — GP\n\n## 1. Accounts\n\n| System | Username | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| Microsoft 365 | tmokoenahart@brightwaterbenefits.example | MFA enrolled Monday, authenticator app |\n| Claims platform | tmokoena-hart | role: analyst-L1 |\n| VPN | bbg\\tmokoenahart | cert expires 2027-05-18 |\n| Payroll self-service | 618THM | she sets her own password at first login |\n\n- Temporary password for all of the above: Welcome!Lake26 — forced change at first sign-in.\n- Door badge no. 0047731; alarm PIN 5820 (shared with the claims pod, yes I know).\n- She asked us to use \"Thandi\" as her display name. Legal name stays in HR.\n\n## 2. Hardware\n\n- Laptop: ThinkPad T14 Gen 4, serial **PF4XK2M9**, asset tag BBG-LT-0392, Windows 11 Pro.\n  - Wi-Fi MAC `3C:6A:A7:1B:90:4E`, dock Ethernet MAC `00-E0-4C-68-3A-17`\n  - BitLocker recovery key ID 7F2C19A4 escrowed to the tenant\n- Phone: company iPhone, IMEI 35 693803 564380 9, number (612) 555-0193\n- Monitor x2 from stock, no serials tracked.\n\n## 3. Network\n\n- Static DHCP reservation `10.40.12.57` on VLAN 40 (claims). Printer is `10.40.12.9`.\n- VPN concentrator: `vpn.brightwaterbenefits.example` → 203.0.113.18 (TCP 443). IPv6 is `2001:db8:40:12::57` if she ends up on the new stack.\n- Home IP allow-listed for the first two weeks while her token ships: 198.51.100.203. Remove by June 1, 2026.\n- 802.1X on the wired ports; the private ranges are the usual RFC 1918 space.\n\n## 4. HR / accommodation items passed to IT\n\n- Leilani forwarded an approved accommodation: screen reader (JAWS) and a 27-inch high-contrast display — Thandi has low vision. Software licence key is in the vault, not here.\n- She needs the laptop shipped, not picked up: 5121 Xerxes Ave S, Apt 3, Minneapolis, MN 55410. Signature required.\n- Personal email for the shipping notice: thandi.mh@mail.example. Personal cell 651.555.0128.\n\n## 5. Open items\n\n1. Claims platform vendor still has to approve the seat (SOC 2 access review) — Gus chasing.\n2. Add to the `claims-phi` group only after HIPAA training is logged.\n3. Confirm with Brightwater Benefits Group, Inc. HR whether her work authorization (H-1B transfer) start date changes anything for payroll access. Not an IT question but it came to us.\n4. Intranet profile: https://intranet.brightwaterbenefits.example/people/tmokoenahart", "kind": "Markdown document", "detail": "406 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Thandiwe Mokoena-Hart", "Leilani Kahananui", "Gus Papadakis", "Thandi", "Thandi.mh", "Gus", "tmokoenahart"], "companies": ["brightwaterbenefits", "Northloop Managed IT", "Lake26", "Msn", "Brightwater Benefits Group", "Inc."]}, "topics": {"places": ["Minneapolis", "Northloop", "Lake", "Thandi's Apt 3", "Brightwater Benefits Group, Inc."], "health": ["low vision"], "sensitive": ["claims analyst", "employer", "managed IT", "payroll self-service", "door badge", "alarm PIN", "temporary password", "screen reader", "JAWS", "high-contrast display", "personal cell"], "names": ["Thandiwe", "Leilani", "Gus", "tmokoenahart"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 22, "end": 43, "text": "Thandiwe Mokoena-Hart", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Thandiwe 